## Proposed target state (Proxmox VE {{ target_pve_release }} / Debian {{ target_debian_suite }})

Proxmox VE 9 uses the deb822 `.sources` format. The upgrade guide's own
`sed`-based rewrite from `{{ source_debian_suite }}` to `{{ target_debian_suite }}`
is applied first, then the Proxmox repositories are converted.

`/etc/apt/sources.list.d/debian.sources`

```text
Types: deb
URIs: http://deb.debian.org/debian/
Suites: {{ target_debian_suite }} {{ target_debian_suite }}-updates
Components: main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/debian-archive-keyring.gpg

Types: deb
URIs: http://security.debian.org/debian-security/
Suites: {{ target_debian_suite }}-security
Components: main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/debian-archive-keyring.gpg
```

{% if pve_upgrade_precheck_repo_facts.has_enterprise %}
`/etc/apt/sources.list.d/pve-enterprise.sources` (subscription required)

```text
Types: deb
URIs: https://enterprise.proxmox.com/debian/pve
Suites: {{ target_debian_suite }}
Components: pve-enterprise
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/proxmox-archive-keyring.gpg
```
{% else %}
`/etc/apt/sources.list.d/proxmox.sources` (no subscription)

```text
Types: deb
URIs: http://download.proxmox.com/debian/pve
Suites: {{ target_debian_suite }}
Components: pve-no-subscription
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/proxmox-archive-keyring.gpg
```
{% endif %}

